	<string>Global marks your approximate city on your globe wallpaper. Your location is rounded to around 10 km and never leaves this Mac.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Global marks your approximate city on your globe wallpaper. Your location is rounded to around 10 km and never leaves this Mac.</string>
	<key>NSHumanReadableCopyright</key>
	<string>MIT Licence. Earth imagery: NASA Visible Earth. Land data: Natural Earth.</string>
